Cellward-only, opt-in CLIPBOARD/PRIMARY fallback for a windowless X11 client.
Serial zero is consumed by Cellward's launch-local relay, never authorized
as a host compositor write. Existing keyboard serials are unchanged.
Upstream source context: MPL-2.0, xwayland-satellite v0.8.3.

